@block {"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0,"concealed":false,"annotationId":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"行内公式可以像文字一样参与叙述：若 "},{"type":"mathInline","attrs":{"latex":"a^2+b^2=c^2","delimiter":"$"}},{"type":"text","text":"，三条边组成一个直角三角形。点击公式可以修改它的 LaTeX 源码。"}]}
